Photorealistic sprite sheet of retro 1980s Hi-Fi fluorescent VFD music notes, viewed perfectly straight-on, on a pure flat black background. Exactly six separate objects in one evenly spaced horizontal row, none touching, each fully visible with generous black space around it, all the same height: 1 a single eighth note, 2 two beamed eighth notes, 3 a quarter note, 4 two beamed sixteenth notes, 5 a half note with hollow head, 6 a single sixteenth note. Each note is formed of luminous fluorescent teal VFD vacuum display segments with a warm coral-red glow at the note heads, like a vintage Japanese stereo frequency analyzer. Consistent style and lighting across all six. Crisp focus. No staff lines, no text, no numbers, no labels, no mounting hardware, no watermark.
